    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore the island, meet 14 sexy monster girls, and let their charms pull you in. Build your harem and take things further. maybe impregnate them!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736290/extras/85e2c678984907772a9b8e652338a1ef.avif?t=1752662600\" data-has-big width=800 height=574 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture to a secluded island, where 14 seductive monster girls await, each ready to capture your heart and fulfill your deepest desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736290/extras/f6fb04495ff508310b402804aff50f25.avif?t=1752662600\" data-has-big width=800 height=525 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend yourself and figure out each monster girl's weakness, but watch out! If you can't resist their tempting ways, you might end up completely drained by their allure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736290/extras/dc93a30ebd6ed4ce3138f5ba42a2eac9.avif?t=1752662600\" data-has-big width=800 height=490 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick the girl who catches your eye and take her on a date. Who knows, you might just end up spending a wild night at her place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736290/extras/2c1f3ab0449726213c6e4346a7513617.avif?t=1752662600\" data-has-big width=800 height=540 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tie the knot with your one true love, or go all in and build your own harem.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736290/extras/b0b9378165ee1964303091ca4a592da5.avif?t=1752662600\" data-has-big width=800 height=581 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience intimate moments that could lead to pregnancy and even more wild, passionate nights together</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
